Thank uou for contacting Specific Needs.<br />
<br />
Medical clearance is required when the use of any medical equipment is used in-flight.<br />
<br />
Your treating doctor will need to complete the Travel Clearance Form (PDF) for assessment in consultation with Qantas Medical Services, at least 5 days prior to travel.<br />
<br />
As not all battery or electrically powered equipment can be used onboard, please contact Qantas Customer Specific Needs team to discuss your options on 1800 177 474 (within Australia) or +61 2 9123 7471 (outside Australia), select option 3.<br />
<br />
If you require further assistance regarding medical equipment, please reply back to this email.</body>
